WEBVTT

01:36.520 --> 01:39.930
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.070 --> 01:41.930
[Episode 33]

01:50.530 --> 01:51.289
Where's Fenghua?

01:51.310 --> 01:52.120
Sleeping in the bedroom.

01:52.150 --> 01:52.870
What's up with her?

01:52.890 --> 01:54.680
She's been feeling dizzy lately, sometimes even unable to stand.

01:54.710 --> 01:55.850
She might be worn out.

02:32.970 --> 02:33.970
Why are you here?

02:38.470 --> 02:40.030
Let me take you to the hospital

02:40.430 --> 02:41.400
for a check-up.

02:44.030 --> 02:44.810
I've already had one.

02:45.220 --> 02:46.290
Nothing serious.

02:47.430 --> 02:49.490
This constant dizziness is no small matter.

02:49.630 --> 02:51.220
Granny Ma used to have the same symptom.

02:54.030 --> 02:55.680
I'm still young. How can you compare me to her?

02:56.500 --> 02:58.530
Do you think someone at my age could have a stroke?

02:59.320 --> 03:00.740
Just mind your own business.

03:03.760 --> 03:05.400
I'll handle my own affairs.

03:05.910 --> 03:07.180
Just stay out of this.

03:11.010 --> 03:12.100
So what did you do?

03:13.570 --> 03:15.090
I've been busy all day,

03:15.530 --> 03:17.170
getting He a death certificate

03:17.680 --> 03:18.710
and contacting a funeral parlor.

03:19.390 --> 03:21.390
Has Bee made any effort at all?

03:21.870 --> 03:23.360
Did it occur to you that, given his family's situation,

03:23.380 --> 03:24.980
it was even uneasy for them to arrange a funeral?

03:25.340 --> 03:27.810
Have you thought about giving He some final dignity?

03:30.970 --> 03:33.970
Handle your own affairs? How dare you say that?

03:43.380 --> 03:45.120
Yes, you're right.

03:47.450 --> 03:48.970
I didn't take them into account.

03:50.000 --> 03:50.880
I only

03:52.260 --> 03:54.700
thought about getting more compensation for them.

03:57.710 --> 03:59.190
I wasn't thoughtful enough.

04:00.880 --> 04:01.530
I was wrong.

04:09.550 --> 04:10.840
I'm really sorry.

04:11.910 --> 04:14.430
I'll listen to your advice.

04:15.890 --> 04:16.829
And I'll adapt.

04:18.390 --> 04:19.920
You should also listen to my suggestion.

04:21.890 --> 04:22.940
What suggestion?

04:23.300 --> 04:24.300
Go for a medical check-up.

04:25.660 --> 04:26.660
Let's go to Xiehe Hospital

04:26.900 --> 04:28.250
for the best doctor.

04:29.800 --> 04:30.830
Not now.

04:30.860 --> 04:32.630
Not before I wrap these things up.

04:32.650 --> 04:34.250
How much compensation can there be?

04:43.960 --> 04:45.270
We're still working on it.

04:46.820 --> 04:47.820
We hope...

04:50.440 --> 04:52.480
We hope to get the highest level.

04:58.960 --> 05:00.190
A new day has begun.

05:00.220 --> 05:01.680
Be careful on the way, everyone!

05:01.800 --> 05:02.600
Okay!

05:02.680 --> 05:04.090
Follow the traffic rules!

05:04.190 --> 05:04.920
Okay!

05:04.940 --> 05:06.000
Come on! Our slogan!

05:06.630 --> 05:07.920
Bee! Bee!

05:08.070 --> 05:09.390
Have a safe trip!

05:09.510 --> 05:10.070
Let's go!

05:10.160 --> 05:10.890
Go!

05:22.040 --> 05:23.530
Listen to me.

05:23.600 --> 05:25.720
That guy doesn't look like a good person!

05:25.750 --> 05:26.390
Mom,

05:26.390 --> 05:27.800
if the people from Yuntu are not good,

05:27.800 --> 05:29.560
are the people from Bee any better?

05:29.630 --> 05:31.750
How can you believe those people will settle it?

05:31.800 --> 05:34.270
Haven't you seen the attitude of their company?

05:34.390 --> 05:35.480
If they had any conscience,

05:35.510 --> 05:36.720
would Tianming have had an accident?

05:37.430 --> 05:38.840
But I think

05:38.920 --> 05:40.360
something's fishy about this matter.

05:40.390 --> 05:42.190
I don't care if there's anything fishy!

05:42.220 --> 05:43.750
You really can't go!

05:43.800 --> 05:44.630
Listen to me, okay?

05:44.680 --> 05:46.560
You promised Ms. Xia before.

05:46.560 --> 05:48.750
You're breaking your promise if you go now.

05:48.770 --> 05:50.360
What did I promise her?

05:50.390 --> 05:52.510
She said Xie Wanghe would get us compensation.

05:52.540 --> 05:53.330
So where's the money?

05:53.350 --> 05:54.360
I can't see them right now,

05:54.390 --> 05:55.800
let alone the money!

05:55.820 --> 05:57.610
They're obviously going back on their words!

05:58.070 --> 05:58.830
What's going on?

06:00.430 --> 06:01.950
Please talk her out of it.

06:01.970 --> 06:04.310
Let her stop messing around.

06:04.510 --> 06:05.390
What does she want to do?

06:06.510 --> 06:08.000
Someone came here

06:08.020 --> 06:09.950
and said they'd pay for our lawsuit

06:10.000 --> 06:12.390
to claim compensation from Bee.

06:12.390 --> 06:14.390
They also talked about holding a press conference

06:14.390 --> 06:16.430
to make this issue blow up completely!

06:16.460 --> 06:17.460
Who said that?

06:18.290 --> 06:20.340
I suspect it was someone from Yuntu.

06:20.480 --> 06:21.630
Yuntu?

06:21.680 --> 06:23.860
I have his business card.

06:24.280 --> 06:25.600
What are you doing?

06:25.660 --> 06:27.250
They're genuinely trying to help us.

06:27.280 --> 06:29.190
They've put in money, effort, and labor.

06:29.210 --> 06:30.700
Don't be ungrateful.

06:30.720 --> 06:32.530
You believe that?

06:32.560 --> 06:34.560
This is apparently a business battle.

06:34.580 --> 06:35.690
They want to use this case

06:35.720 --> 06:37.420
to completely ruin Bee's reputation.

06:37.440 --> 06:38.950
I don't care about their intentions.

06:38.980 --> 06:41.270
I only know they've paid real money.

06:42.820 --> 06:43.690
How much?

06:45.120 --> 06:46.440
How much money?

06:48.920 --> 06:49.920
300,000.

06:50.290 --> 06:51.860
I've received the transfer on my card.

06:52.690 --> 06:53.800
No matter what,

06:53.830 --> 06:56.140
they transferred the money before even signing an agreement.

06:56.260 --> 06:57.190
What about you guys?

06:57.220 --> 06:58.370
What have you done?

06:58.470 --> 07:00.370
Can you shut up?

07:00.400 --> 07:02.400
Ms. Xia is doing this for our own good.

07:02.420 --> 07:03.930
You should be grateful!

07:03.960 --> 07:06.180
Anyone can say nice things.

07:06.530 --> 07:08.240
If she really cares about us,

07:08.260 --> 07:09.700
she should give us money.

07:09.730 --> 07:10.900
I only believe in money now.

07:13.880 --> 07:15.270
Return the money you received.

07:15.460 --> 07:16.640
Just 300,000 yuan, right?

07:16.840 --> 07:17.350
I'll pay it.

07:19.180 --> 07:20.800
Where can you get that money?

07:20.830 --> 07:22.030
Don't worry about that.

07:22.390 --> 07:23.530
Just return the money right away.

07:23.560 --> 07:24.710
I'll cover the losses.

07:25.170 --> 07:28.210
Also, please give me one more day.

07:28.550 --> 07:30.030
I'll make sure Wanghe

07:30.070 --> 07:31.930
resolves the compensation issue as soon as possible.

07:33.820 --> 07:34.540
Return it.

07:35.250 --> 07:36.070
Go return it now.

07:44.330 --> 07:45.090
Hello.

07:45.120 --> 07:46.930
Ms. Xia, what's the matter?

07:47.570 --> 07:49.300
Are you available tomorrow morning?

07:49.330 --> 07:50.940
I'd like to discuss something with you.

07:51.840 --> 07:53.570
Can't we talk about it on the phone?

07:54.240 --> 07:54.950
It's good news.

07:54.970 --> 07:55.820
Let's talk when we meet.

07:56.450 --> 07:57.450
See you tomorrow at 10 AM.

07:57.480 --> 07:58.670
I'll send you the address.

07:58.690 --> 07:59.380
Alright.

07:59.740 --> 08:01.130
Send it to my phone.

08:01.480 --> 08:02.870
Okay, bye-bye.

08:42.220 --> 08:42.980
Mr. Meng.

08:44.470 --> 08:47.130
Now that your meeting is over, can we talk?

08:55.790 --> 08:56.790
Go ahead.

08:57.240 --> 08:58.760
How much compensation do you expect the company to pay?

08:59.610 --> 09:01.880
The more, the better, of course.

09:02.660 --> 09:04.300
You know He's family situation.

09:04.330 --> 09:06.490
I know! And I feel sorry for them too!

09:07.330 --> 09:09.980
But I don't want the company to pay a penny.

09:10.720 --> 09:11.200
What?

09:11.240 --> 09:12.550
We can pay as much as they want personally,

09:12.550 --> 09:14.630
but the company can't. Do you understand?

09:24.150 --> 09:25.030
Xie Wanghe,

09:25.570 --> 09:27.810
the company is about to go public.

09:27.840 --> 09:30.410
We're facing millions of delivery riders.

09:30.510 --> 09:32.400
Any excessive compensation,

09:32.430 --> 09:33.510
if set as a precedent,

09:33.540 --> 09:35.780
will become a noose around our necks.

09:36.470 --> 09:38.650
It's a domino effect.

09:42.020 --> 09:44.560
Meng, how can you be so cold-blooded?

09:44.610 --> 09:45.890
For a businessman,

09:45.910 --> 09:47.570
"cold-blooded" isn't a negative term.

09:47.590 --> 09:49.650
He died in the line of duty.

09:49.680 --> 09:51.590
With the family's pillar gone,

09:51.620 --> 09:53.800
it's hard for the widow and orphan to survive!

09:56.890 --> 09:58.900
The company will definitely go public next year.

09:58.930 --> 10:00.650
Have you calculated your own net worth?

10:01.490 --> 10:02.780
If you really can't bear to see it,

10:02.800 --> 10:04.240
just pay out of your own pocket.

10:04.270 --> 10:06.190
Pay for peace of mind.

10:35.860 --> 10:36.610
[Slow Down]

10:37.000 --> 10:38.110
[Slow Down]

10:38.110 --> 10:40.570
[Fenghua Express]

10:47.830 --> 10:49.710
How's it going? Any updates?

11:14.210 --> 11:17.910
[Xie Wanghe] [August 20th, 2015]

11:18.610 --> 11:19.730
Do you have any inkpad?

11:35.600 --> 11:38.480
My son, I miss you.

11:41.030 --> 11:43.150
My son...

11:47.520 --> 11:50.190
I miss you so much...

11:54.700 --> 11:56.460
My son...

11:58.900 --> 12:01.460
I miss you.

12:05.950 --> 12:07.520
Son...

12:11.710 --> 12:12.750
Ma'am,

12:13.470 --> 12:14.350
Mrs. He,

12:15.390 --> 12:16.230
I know

12:17.340 --> 12:18.570
I bear the main responsibility

12:19.140 --> 12:20.750
for Tianming's accident

12:21.850 --> 12:23.610
I'm not asking for your forgiveness,

12:24.220 --> 12:27.900
but I will do what I should.

12:29.160 --> 12:30.740
I'll pay off your mortgage

12:32.420 --> 12:33.430
for the house,

12:33.710 --> 12:35.010
all at once.

12:35.580 --> 12:38.680
And also for the babies Mrs. He's carrying,

12:38.990 --> 12:42.140
I'll also sponsor their tuition.

12:43.220 --> 12:45.530
This is my letter of commitment.

12:49.140 --> 12:50.750
Just with a worthless piece of paper,

12:51.200 --> 12:53.440
you want us to let go of Bee?

12:53.570 --> 12:54.970
Dream on!

12:56.270 --> 12:58.570
We won't let you go!

13:07.530 --> 13:08.240
Mrs. He,

13:09.740 --> 13:12.400
the company has already initiated the compensation process.

13:13.170 --> 13:14.420
There will be bereavement payments.

13:15.220 --> 13:16.420
This letter of commitment

13:17.550 --> 13:19.230
is my personal promise.

13:19.580 --> 13:21.170
If you don't trust it,

13:21.780 --> 13:23.990
you can have a lawyer notarize it.

13:25.400 --> 13:27.020
You have my word.

13:27.640 --> 13:29.070
I'll definitely fulfill it.

13:40.370 --> 13:42.900
My poor son...

13:48.360 --> 13:50.470
I miss you!

13:57.410 --> 13:59.880
My poor son...

14:21.740 --> 14:23.360
I feel something's off.

14:24.230 --> 14:25.710
A host of netizens are denouncing you

14:26.410 --> 14:27.700
with particularly harsh words.

14:28.840 --> 14:30.280
Isn't that normal?

14:32.050 --> 14:33.240
I am responsible

14:33.980 --> 14:34.980
for He's death.

14:37.510 --> 14:38.420
But,

14:39.490 --> 14:41.080
it feels like it's organized.

14:41.920 --> 14:44.200
Too many newly registered users.

14:44.220 --> 14:45.420
I think

14:45.810 --> 14:47.970
someone must have organized an army of trolls.

14:47.990 --> 14:48.870
You mean Yuntu?

14:48.900 --> 14:50.020
No matter who it is,

14:50.630 --> 14:51.750
if we don't handle it soon,

14:51.780 --> 14:53.420
things will surely get out of hand in the media.

15:02.790 --> 15:05.900
A-Actually, no one expected

15:05.930 --> 15:08.100
such extreme weather that day.

15:08.210 --> 15:10.280
We also lost one of our colleagues.

15:12.250 --> 15:14.750
The company didn't even have time to celebrate before...

15:14.750 --> 15:15.960
I see.

15:16.200 --> 15:17.000
We're well aware

15:17.020 --> 15:18.670
of what you just said.

15:19.080 --> 15:20.600
We just want to hear

15:20.870 --> 15:21.840
something you know,

15:21.840 --> 15:23.200
and also

15:23.200 --> 15:25.050
the juicy information we want to know.

15:25.200 --> 15:25.720
You get it, right?

15:27.000 --> 15:27.850
Excuse me,

15:28.080 --> 15:28.870
I need to use the restroom.

15:38.000 --> 15:38.960
Li.

15:40.630 --> 15:41.350
Mr. Qiu.

15:44.530 --> 15:46.270
Let me show you something.

15:47.480 --> 15:48.470
Take a closer look.

15:51.340 --> 15:56.800
[Xiangmanlou Restaurant] [July 10th]

15:51.340 --> 15:56.800
[Business Trip in Guangzhou] [From July 1st to July 5th]

15:51.340 --> 15:56.800
[Jiangpan Hotel] [June 29th]

15:59.870 --> 16:00.480
Mr. Qiu...

16:00.510 --> 16:01.150
Mr. Qiu, I...

16:01.320 --> 16:02.080
Why so nervous?

16:03.000 --> 16:04.480
Improper expense claims

16:05.750 --> 16:07.550
are not rare in big companies like ours.

16:08.390 --> 16:09.330
These of yours

16:10.320 --> 16:12.240
are very, very small amounts,

16:12.980 --> 16:15.020
not reaching the level of misappropriation.

16:15.630 --> 16:16.440
At most,

16:17.870 --> 16:19.090
you'll just be fired

16:19.320 --> 16:21.200
with a little stain left on your resume.

16:21.860 --> 16:22.800
-Mr. Qiu, I...
-Li,

16:23.480 --> 16:25.080
I remember you joined the company

16:27.240 --> 16:28.440
about three years ago, right?

16:30.080 --> 16:31.000
Yeah, three years ago.

16:31.440 --> 16:33.080
When did you start working

16:33.080 --> 16:34.440
as Mr. Xie's assistant?

16:36.180 --> 16:37.100
In the summer

16:38.050 --> 16:38.820
of last year.

16:39.270 --> 16:39.940
Well, then,

16:40.990 --> 16:42.770
Mr. Xie must treat you well, right?

16:43.750 --> 16:44.410
Yeah...

16:44.440 --> 16:44.870
Not bad...

16:44.870 --> 16:46.070
Did he give you a raise?

16:47.480 --> 16:48.160
Nope.

16:48.440 --> 16:49.220
Then year-end bonus?

16:49.540 --> 16:50.230
Others

16:50.250 --> 16:51.410
get double pay at the end of the year.

16:51.670 --> 16:52.870
Given your relationship with him,

16:52.870 --> 16:54.450
you must get at least triple pay, right?

16:57.630 --> 16:58.440
Li,

16:59.510 --> 17:02.140
from the first day you joined the company three years ago,

17:03.260 --> 17:04.480
I could tell

17:04.480 --> 17:06.480
that you were a loyal young man.

17:07.079 --> 17:08.880
But don't you think

17:08.880 --> 17:11.160
it's too foolish to stick to this loyalty?

17:11.609 --> 17:12.410
As your senior,

17:12.440 --> 17:13.750
I must tell you

17:14.329 --> 17:15.470
you need to remember this.

17:16.349 --> 17:17.720
People like Xie Wanghe,

17:19.069 --> 17:20.829
have no conscience at all.

17:22.020 --> 17:24.460
He'll definitely be kicked out after this incident.

17:25.000 --> 17:25.750
So I hope

17:25.750 --> 17:27.550
you can seize this opportunity

17:28.369 --> 17:29.330
to switch sides.

17:39.390 --> 17:40.110
This year,

17:40.110 --> 17:41.000
multiple traffic accidents

17:41.000 --> 17:43.160
involving delivery riders have occurred nationwide,

17:43.160 --> 17:45.310
exposing problems such as poor platform management

17:45.310 --> 17:47.460
and weak safety awareness among delivery riders.

17:47.290 --> 17:48.000
[What's the story behind the racing food delivery riders? A food delivery rider died in a car accident in the rain.]

17:47.920 --> 17:50.030
Concerning traffic violations in the food delivery industry,

17:48.000 --> 17:48.630
[A food delivery rider died in a car accident in the rain. The delivery riders' struggles in extreme weather.]

17:48.000 --> 17:48.630
[A food delivery rider died in a car accident in the rain. A victim of a race.]

17:48.650 --> 17:49.450
[A food delivery rider died in a car accident in the rain. The speed of city life in a downpour.]

17:48.650 --> 17:49.450
[A food delivery rider died in a car accident in the rain. A delivery rider fell in the rain.]

17:49.480 --> 17:50.820
[A food delivery rider died in a car accident in the rain. The speed of city life in a downpour.]

17:49.480 --> 17:50.820
[A food delivery rider died in a car accident in the rain. A victim of a race.]

17:50.270 --> 17:51.880
national departments have jointly issued

17:50.860 --> 17:55.590
[Bee Delivery]

17:51.880 --> 17:53.110
a comprehensive governance plan

17:53.110 --> 17:55.480
to promote the establishment of a long-term traffic safety mechanism.

17:56.000 --> 17:58.320
It calls for the platform enterprises' primary responsibility,

17:58.590 --> 17:59.830
such as adding traffic violation rates

17:59.830 --> 18:01.880
to their business permit assessments,

18:02.030 --> 18:03.830
building a safety file system for delivery riders,

18:04.130 --> 18:07.090
implementing industry intervention for repeat offenders,

18:07.440 --> 18:08.920
and introducing flexible working hours.

18:08.920 --> 18:12.790
Mr. Meng, I'd like to ask about your upcoming IPO...

18:12.790 --> 18:14.110
But to you, this incident...

18:14.110 --> 18:15.750
Please trust Bee.

18:15.750 --> 18:17.110
Bee will definitely give everyone

18:17.110 --> 18:18.720
a satisfactory response.

18:28.110 --> 18:29.550
We will answer

18:29.550 --> 18:31.830
your questions one by one

18:31.830 --> 18:34.030
at the upcoming press conference. I promise

18:34.030 --> 18:35.110
that we, Bee,

18:35.110 --> 18:37.680
can give everyone a clear response

18:37.680 --> 18:39.110
and a satisfactory answer.

18:39.790 --> 18:41.590
Is there any information you can disclose?

18:50.200 --> 18:51.750
Please rest assured, everyone.

18:51.790 --> 18:54.550
We'll make sure to give everyone a satisfactory response.

18:55.030 --> 18:55.960
Mr. Xie is there!

18:55.960 --> 19:00.770
Mr. Xie...

19:00.790 --> 19:01.190
Mr. Xie...

19:01.220 --> 19:02.270
Could you please tell us

19:02.300 --> 19:04.760
if you've reached an agreement with the victim's family?

19:04.790 --> 19:06.680
Bee Group is about to go public.

19:06.700 --> 19:09.170
Is there any information you can disclose?

19:22.510 --> 19:23.510
Mr. Xie, when can you

19:23.510 --> 19:24.590
explain it to us?

19:24.590 --> 19:25.350
Mr. Xie!

19:25.370 --> 19:27.350
Mr. Xie, give us an explanation!

19:27.350 --> 19:29.570
Don't keep us in suspense, Mr. Xie!

19:30.030 --> 19:30.880
Mr. Xie!

19:39.160 --> 19:41.780
Good morning, friends from the media.

19:42.310 --> 19:45.790
As the CEO of Bee Group,

19:46.000 --> 19:48.570
I, along with all the employees of Bee,

19:48.640 --> 19:50.550
grieve over the loss

19:51.300 --> 19:53.790
of our company's delivery rider,

19:53.990 --> 19:56.280
He Tianming, in a traffic accident.

19:54.380 --> 19:57.640
[Bee Hungry Group Technology Co., Ltd.] [Press Conference]

19:57.080 --> 20:00.370
We express our deepest condolences to the deceased

20:00.440 --> 20:03.780
and extend our sincere sympathies to his family.

20:03.830 --> 20:05.070
We sincerely apologize

20:07.350 --> 20:08.480
to him and his family,

20:18.070 --> 20:19.930
and also to the citizens

20:20.050 --> 20:23.380
who have been supporting and following Bee

20:23.810 --> 20:25.600
all this time.

20:25.880 --> 20:27.400
After the accident,

20:27.420 --> 20:29.140
we've been working hard

20:29.170 --> 20:31.210
to investigate the cause of the accident

20:31.230 --> 20:34.710
and conducting internal self-examination and introspection.

20:35.380 --> 20:37.700
During our self-examination,

20:37.810 --> 20:38.530
we found out that

20:39.310 --> 20:40.610
Xie Wanghe,

20:40.810 --> 20:44.050
the person in charge of Bee's business in the Haidian District,

20:44.070 --> 20:46.120
bears undeniable responsibility

20:46.140 --> 20:48.230
for this accident.

20:49.600 --> 20:51.780
Thus, he formally submitted

20:51.820 --> 20:53.940
his resignation to the company.

20:54.400 --> 20:56.100
This demonstrates our group's determination

20:57.020 --> 20:58.770
to thoroughly investigate this case

20:59.050 --> 21:01.900
and rectify existing issues.

21:02.440 --> 21:04.600
We also sincerely request the supervision

21:04.630 --> 21:06.110
of all media

21:06.470 --> 21:07.280
and all citizens.

21:12.700 --> 21:22.240
[Bee Hungry Group Technology Co., Ltd.] [Press Conference]

21:31.590 --> 21:35.110
[Bee Hungry Group Technology Co., Ltd.] [Press Conference]

21:32.590 --> 21:33.680
Mr. Xie Wanghe,

21:33.680 --> 21:35.720
your company's caused seven traffic accidents over the past three years.

21:35.720 --> 21:37.350
Don't you think it's too late

21:37.350 --> 21:38.400
to make an apology now?

21:38.400 --> 21:39.790
What specific compensation will your company

21:39.790 --> 21:40.940
offer to the rider's family?

21:41.030 --> 21:42.130
I hereby

21:45.070 --> 21:47.200
express my deepest condolences and apologies

21:49.550 --> 21:50.790
to Mr. He Tianming

21:52.240 --> 21:53.510
and his family,

21:55.620 --> 21:56.380
I'm so sorry.

22:03.890 --> 22:05.600
Fenghua, Fenghua!

22:05.940 --> 22:07.030
Bad news...

22:08.270 --> 22:08.830
Mr. Xie,

22:08.830 --> 22:10.480
what is your view on the cause

22:10.480 --> 22:11.690
of this accident?

22:12.240 --> 22:13.570
I bear the main responsibility.

22:14.170 --> 22:15.750
It has nothing to do with the company.

22:15.780 --> 22:17.620
It stemmed from my personal decision.

22:18.080 --> 22:19.960
Mr. Xie, what's your take on delivery riders

22:19.980 --> 22:22.200
violating traffic rules?

22:22.960 --> 22:24.440
This is something we need to address

22:25.300 --> 22:28.210
with our delivery riders in the future,

22:26.290 --> 22:29.850
[Wanghe]

22:29.480 --> 22:30.640
about legal education.

22:30.800 --> 22:33.380
We hope that all delivery riders

22:33.410 --> 22:34.690
can obey traffic rules.

22:33.530 --> 22:36.760
[Wanghe]

22:34.710 --> 22:36.120
Safety comes first.

22:36.830 --> 22:37.590
Mr. Xie,

22:37.590 --> 22:39.460
what responsibility do you hold

22:39.550 --> 22:40.640
for Bee Group's incident this time?

22:40.640 --> 22:42.010
I bear the main responsibility.

22:42.620 --> 22:44.440
Mr. Xie, do you have anything to say

22:44.440 --> 22:45.740
to all the food delivery riders?

22:47.640 --> 22:49.430
I hope all riders,

22:50.350 --> 22:52.300
while working hard to earn their bread,

22:53.770 --> 22:56.500
can make sure they keep themselves safe.

23:01.540 --> 23:03.450
The news of a food delivery rider's accidental death

23:03.480 --> 23:04.710
during his work in extreme weather

23:04.730 --> 23:06.400
has drawn massive social attention.

23:06.630 --> 23:07.800
The food delivery platform, Bee,

23:07.830 --> 23:10.480
held a press conference yesterday regarding this issue.

23:10.510 --> 23:13.100
They announced at the scene that Xie,

23:13.120 --> 23:15.120
the person in charge of the Haidian Department,

23:15.150 --> 23:16.870
bore undeniable responsibility for this accident.

23:16.890 --> 23:18.700
Xie has now been dismissed.

23:18.730 --> 23:20.980
The follow-up work for the food delivery riders

23:21.010 --> 23:23.180
is being further completed.

23:24.720 --> 23:25.410
Hello?

23:25.430 --> 23:26.650
Hello, Fenghua.

23:26.680 --> 23:27.450
Wanghe's out of contact.

23:27.480 --> 23:28.370
Can you reach him?

23:28.640 --> 23:29.970
He's not answering my calls.

23:30.000 --> 23:31.510
I was just about to call you.

23:34.790 --> 23:36.550
Why don't you come to Wanghe's place first?

23:36.550 --> 23:38.060
Let's discuss what to do next.

23:38.470 --> 23:40.230
Okay, I'll be right there.

23:42.490 --> 23:43.780
Ms. Xia,

23:44.730 --> 23:46.030
I'm sorry.

23:47.610 --> 23:50.300
I didn't know things would end up like this.

23:51.260 --> 23:52.370
Let's not talk about this now.

23:52.390 --> 23:53.680
I need to find him first.

23:54.020 --> 23:55.460
You two should stay in more

23:55.480 --> 23:56.850
and avoid interviews lately.

23:56.870 --> 23:58.900
Let's wait and see Bee's attitude first.

24:05.020 --> 24:08.490
[Fenghua Express]

24:06.540 --> 24:07.250
Hello.

24:07.290 --> 24:09.800
Are Mr. He Tianming's family members living here?

24:10.360 --> 24:11.510
What are you here for?

24:12.400 --> 24:14.600
We're here on behalf of Bee to talk to them

24:14.620 --> 24:16.330
about compensation.

24:20.090 --> 24:22.080
Finally remembered to do some proper things, huh?

24:31.350 --> 24:32.550
What took you so long?

24:32.570 --> 24:34.610
Bee's staff came to discuss compensation,

24:34.640 --> 24:35.400
and I got held up.

24:35.880 --> 24:37.110
Wanghe's phone is on,

24:37.110 --> 24:38.230
but he's not answering.

24:38.590 --> 24:40.030
Could he have gone back to his hometown?

24:41.630 --> 24:42.410
No.

24:42.440 --> 24:43.440
Why not?

24:43.460 --> 24:45.240
If he went back now, he'd have to explain everything to everyone.

24:45.270 --> 24:46.030
How troublesome!

24:47.070 --> 24:48.350
I guess Wanghe's hiding somewhere.

24:55.160 --> 24:56.030
Where are you?

25:05.680 --> 25:07.680
Don't make me call the police.

25:11.060 --> 25:13.940
[Xie Wanghe]

25:24.050 --> 25:25.680
If you still don't reply to my messages,

25:25.680 --> 25:26.590
I'll tell your mom

25:26.590 --> 25:28.720
that we were in a relationship, and now you're abandoning me.

25:31.640 --> 25:32.950
[Xie Wanghe]

25:32.970 --> 25:33.680
[Optical Astronomical Phenomena Hall, Beijing Planetarium]

25:37.510 --> 25:39.150
Wait, where is he?

26:17.850 --> 26:18.640
Did you drink?

26:20.810 --> 26:21.690
Just a little.

26:26.820 --> 26:28.330
I really want to comfort you,

26:29.950 --> 26:32.220
but I don't know what to say.

26:35.250 --> 26:36.250
It's okay.

26:37.240 --> 26:38.030
I don't need that.

26:43.830 --> 26:45.030
You can take a break for a while.

26:45.780 --> 26:47.410
After you adjust your mindset,

26:47.440 --> 26:49.890
you can switch careers to do something else.

26:55.680 --> 26:56.890
I'm really okay.

26:58.000 --> 26:58.960
Don't worry.

27:02.000 --> 27:03.820
This isn't my first failure.

27:06.110 --> 27:07.420
It's just

27:08.790 --> 27:09.790
kinda shameful this time.

27:12.830 --> 27:13.790
I thought

27:14.900 --> 27:16.220
my debut in the media

27:17.350 --> 27:19.350
would be me ringing the bell at Nasdaq.

27:22.110 --> 27:23.920
Never did I expect it to be like this.

27:26.310 --> 27:28.070
I guess people are cursing me like crazy online, right?

27:32.110 --> 27:34.550
Now you're the target of criticism.

27:35.300 --> 27:36.760
If I were your boss,

27:37.120 --> 27:38.570
I'd reward you.

27:47.360 --> 27:48.970
When is He's funeral?

27:49.440 --> 27:50.590
You shouldn't go.

27:52.320 --> 27:53.920
Even if they don't say it aboveboard,

27:54.350 --> 27:55.910
they're still holding grudges deep down inside.

27:57.640 --> 27:59.270
And don't add to their agony.

28:04.780 --> 28:05.530
What about you?

28:06.740 --> 28:08.000
Are you still mad at me?

28:10.050 --> 28:11.780
I'm not the one directly involved.

28:12.520 --> 28:13.560
Besides,

28:14.750 --> 28:16.150
you didn't do it on purpose.

28:17.550 --> 28:18.890
This incident

28:19.350 --> 28:22.070
will gradually fall off the radar in a couple of years.

28:22.950 --> 28:24.870
But for the family,

28:25.010 --> 28:26.600
it's a lifelong pain.

28:28.200 --> 28:30.370
I hope you can learn from this.

28:35.270 --> 28:36.200
Don't worry.

28:38.500 --> 28:40.610
I won't let this kind of thing happen again.

28:49.770 --> 28:52.080
Do you know, in terms of luminosity,

28:52.290 --> 28:53.810
which star shines the brightest?

28:57.820 --> 28:59.130
How could I guess that?

29:02.440 --> 29:03.440
Betelgeuse.

29:05.310 --> 29:07.200
It's over 600 light years away from Earth

29:07.890 --> 29:09.340
and is currently

29:09.370 --> 29:12.100
the star most likely to go supernova.

29:15.820 --> 29:17.930
I saw people saying online

29:19.660 --> 29:21.210
that after we die,

29:22.450 --> 29:24.110
our souls go over there.

29:25.030 --> 29:26.320
Originally,

29:26.550 --> 29:28.640
our souls came from there too.

29:35.740 --> 29:39.030
This reminds me of the days we spent watching stars on the rooftop together

29:39.960 --> 29:42.330
when we were still kids.

29:42.400 --> 29:45.400
♫Twinkle, twinkle, little star♫

29:45.400 --> 29:51.110
♫How I wonder what you are♫

29:51.110 --> 29:56.750
♫Up above the world so high♫

29:56.750 --> 30:01.790
♫Like a diamond in the sky♫

30:08.750 --> 30:14.240
♫Twinkle, twinkle, little star♫

30:14.680 --> 30:19.550
♫How I wonder what you are♫

30:20.550 --> 30:27.110
♫Up above the world so high♫

30:29.250 --> 30:33.930
[Bee Hungry Group Technology Co., Ltd.] [Press Conference]

30:29.830 --> 30:31.600
The news of a food delivery rider's accidental death

30:31.650 --> 30:32.900
during his work in extreme weather

30:32.930 --> 30:34.280
has drawn massive social attention.

30:34.960 --> 30:36.030
The food delivery platform, Bee,

30:36.030 --> 30:38.750
held a press conference yesterday regarding this issue.

30:38.960 --> 30:41.350
They announced at the scene that Xie,

30:41.350 --> 30:43.160
the person in charge of the Haidian Department,

30:43.160 --> 30:44.960
bore undeniable responsibility for this accident.

30:45.160 --> 30:46.950
Xie has now been dismissed.

30:46.970 --> 30:49.180
The follow-up work for the food delivery riders

30:49.250 --> 30:51.160
is being further completed.

30:52.070 --> 30:52.990
Haihong.

30:55.100 --> 30:56.250
Liang Haihong!

30:56.400 --> 30:57.930
Here. Over here.

30:58.000 --> 30:59.760
Have you gotten through to Wanghe?

31:00.270 --> 31:01.480
His phone's off.

31:04.850 --> 31:07.160
Then what about F-Fenghua and H-Haikuo?

31:07.190 --> 31:08.310
Fenghua went to look for him.

31:08.310 --> 31:09.200
Haikuo asked us

31:09.200 --> 31:10.550
to wait patiently.

31:21.240 --> 31:22.270
Where are you going?

31:22.270 --> 31:24.160
I think Wanghe has been wrongly accused.

31:27.210 --> 31:28.010
Why?

31:28.930 --> 31:30.220
In the company.

31:30.240 --> 31:31.750
every adjustment to the rules and regulations

31:31.780 --> 31:32.690
must be reported to the higher-ups

31:32.710 --> 31:34.340
and can only be implemented after their approval.

31:34.360 --> 31:35.930
Despite Wanghe's radical way of doing things,

31:36.030 --> 31:37.350
he definitely has his principles.

31:37.370 --> 31:39.320
I guess the public opinions were out of their control this time,

31:39.420 --> 31:40.390
so the company

31:40.740 --> 31:41.930
made him a scapegoat.

31:42.880 --> 31:43.830
That must be the case.

31:43.830 --> 31:46.110
Yeah, Wanghe's been righteous and kind-hearted

31:46.110 --> 31:47.590
since he was a kid.

31:47.610 --> 31:49.200
He knows when to hold back

31:49.200 --> 31:50.820
instead of acting recklessly.

31:50.850 --> 31:52.680
-Exactly.
-He must have been wrongly accused!

31:52.700 --> 31:54.910
Yeah! He's such a good boy!

31:54.940 --> 31:56.490
It's not a big deal.

31:56.510 --> 31:58.230
After all, internet trends

31:58.310 --> 32:00.290
will die down in a few days.

32:00.320 --> 32:01.310
Or we can have him back

32:01.310 --> 32:02.810
to lay low for a while!

32:02.830 --> 32:05.370
The internet never forgets.

32:05.510 --> 32:07.100
With a record of this incident,

32:07.130 --> 32:09.030
it'll be hard for Wanghe to find a job again.

32:09.710 --> 32:10.920
Why bother finding a job?

32:10.950 --> 32:12.250
As quick-witted as Wanghe is,

32:12.280 --> 32:14.250
can't he come back to start a business on the Flower Street?

32:14.400 --> 32:15.780
Let them all come back,

32:15.800 --> 32:16.630
like Fenghua

32:16.660 --> 32:17.510
and Haikuo!

32:17.530 --> 32:18.770
Doesn't Haikuo do programming?

32:18.800 --> 32:20.120
He can do this job anywhere!

32:20.150 --> 32:21.000
Let them join hands.

32:21.000 --> 32:22.430
I'm sure they'll succeed!

32:22.550 --> 32:24.360
Well said! I totally agree.

32:24.380 --> 32:26.380
Fenghua just said that the life in Beijing had worn her out.

32:26.410 --> 32:27.720
Ask them all to come back.

32:27.750 --> 32:28.950
Beijing may be great,

32:29.030 --> 32:30.550
but it can't beat home sweet home.

32:30.550 --> 32:32.140
What are you talking about?

32:32.160 --> 32:33.270
Beijing is still better.

32:33.400 --> 32:34.270
It's the capital, after all!

32:34.270 --> 32:35.310
What's so good about Beijing?

32:35.310 --> 32:36.880
The high cost of living?

32:37.000 --> 32:38.590
For a bowl of noodles with shredded eel,

32:38.590 --> 32:39.640
h-how much does it cost here?

32:39.680 --> 32:40.310
And how much is it in Beijing?

32:40.310 --> 32:40.960
How much?

32:40.960 --> 32:42.790
Well, Mr. Zhou usually doesn't even charge us.

32:42.830 --> 32:43.750
Right?

32:43.750 --> 32:45.550
You guys go on. I'll go make you some noodles.

32:45.550 --> 32:47.570
That's easy to say!

32:47.680 --> 32:48.790
But if you want them to come back and start a business,

32:48.790 --> 32:50.290
will you provide the startup funds?

32:50.580 --> 32:52.240
So why do you want them to come back?

32:52.240 --> 32:53.790
-We can look after them if they're back!
-Yeah!

32:53.810 --> 32:55.290
Does that really help?

32:55.310 --> 32:56.680
What do they do?

32:56.680 --> 32:58.000
Well, then just look at the status quo!

32:58.000 --> 32:59.680
No one is developing anything anymore.

33:00.610 --> 33:02.420
I think our hometown is quite good.

33:02.510 --> 33:03.700
A place with complete facilities,

33:03.720 --> 33:05.040
lush mountains,

33:05.110 --> 33:07.640
crystal-clear waters, skyscrapers, and everything we need.

33:07.640 --> 33:09.680
On our Flower Street, we have tofu pudding

33:09.680 --> 33:11.550
and noodles early in the morning, shredded eel at noon.

33:11.550 --> 33:13.030
Isn't it wonderful enough?

33:13.030 --> 33:14.200
Look at Wanghe...

33:16.880 --> 33:20.530
[Fenghua Express]

33:25.030 --> 33:26.550
Don't worry, I'm fine.

33:30.840 --> 33:31.790
Then I'll go now.

33:41.150 --> 33:41.950
Fenghua,

33:44.640 --> 33:45.720
don't make any other plans

33:45.740 --> 33:46.780
for this weekend,

33:47.800 --> 33:48.430
Why?

33:48.450 --> 33:49.870
As I said before,

33:49.890 --> 33:51.060
you should go to Xiehe Hospital

33:51.090 --> 33:52.480
for a full medical check-up.

33:53.880 --> 33:56.320
And as I said before, it's unnecessary.

33:57.530 --> 33:59.560
If you don't go, I'll tell your mom.

34:00.610 --> 34:01.830
Whatever.

34:01.460 --> 34:06.310
[Slow Down]

34:02.780 --> 34:04.730
Please, I'm begging you.

34:04.770 --> 34:06.490
You really don't look well lately.

34:06.510 --> 34:07.640
No sparkling eyes.

34:08.270 --> 34:10.139
Even your voice is weak when you speak.

34:10.159 --> 34:11.429
It's heartbreaking to hear.

34:12.880 --> 34:14.380
I'm just jaded.

34:14.840 --> 34:16.400
Can you stop pestering me?

34:16.440 --> 34:17.139
It's just one day.

34:17.159 --> 34:18.280
It's just one day.

34:19.440 --> 34:20.440
I'm begging you.

34:22.880 --> 34:23.920
After the check-up,

34:23.960 --> 34:25.340
we can go shopping together.

34:25.370 --> 34:27.440
I'll buy you anything you want, okay?

34:29.620 --> 34:30.449
Which day?

34:30.469 --> 34:31.800
Saturday or Sunday, whichever is okay

34:31.830 --> 34:33.040
for you.

34:34.090 --> 34:35.199
Alright.

34:36.280 --> 34:37.440
Just wait for my message.

34:37.880 --> 34:39.550
Take care.

34:42.429 --> 34:43.670
Don't forget.

34:43.719 --> 34:45.190
I'll come and pick you up then.

34:59.230 --> 35:00.420
Get some rest early.

36:45.280 --> 36:45.880
What do you think

36:45.920 --> 36:47.080
of this place I found?

36:47.500 --> 36:48.940
A nice shelter from wind and rain.

36:49.970 --> 36:51.940
In the future, this whole area

36:51.960 --> 36:55.030
will be filled with shelves for parcels.

36:55.190 --> 36:57.420
As for the sofa and coffee table

36:57.760 --> 36:58.880
from your station,

36:59.100 --> 37:00.290
I'll put them right here,

37:01.160 --> 37:03.240
making this into an employee rest area.

37:03.700 --> 37:04.880
Am I thoughtful?

37:05.580 --> 37:06.690
That's really nice.

37:06.940 --> 37:07.880
Sun,

37:08.030 --> 37:09.470
it's a brilliant idea to let you

37:09.520 --> 37:10.700
take over the station.

37:13.950 --> 37:15.990
Have you made up your mind?

37:16.130 --> 37:17.200
Are you really quitting?

37:18.240 --> 37:19.460
I'm tired of it.

37:20.010 --> 37:22.080
Remember to treat them well.

37:22.260 --> 37:23.920
If anyone comes to complain to me,

37:23.950 --> 37:25.120
I'll hold you accountable.

37:25.140 --> 37:26.450
C'mon,

37:26.650 --> 37:28.020
just rest assured.

37:28.150 --> 37:30.150
They'll be my staff from now on.

37:30.180 --> 37:31.450
I'll take care of them.

37:32.700 --> 37:33.830
That's a deal.

37:34.570 --> 37:35.180
Okay!

37:36.830 --> 37:38.120
I believe

37:38.150 --> 37:40.920
you've all heard about our station's merging

37:40.940 --> 37:42.640
with Mr. Sun's station.

37:42.670 --> 37:44.710
It's great to have two strong parties join forces.

37:44.800 --> 37:49.660
From now on, for all the steps like sorting, delivery, signing, to after-sales service,

37:49.810 --> 37:53.020
you should follow the standards and requirements

37:53.220 --> 37:54.410
stated in this manual.

37:55.500 --> 37:57.210
So who do we listen to from now on?

38:02.320 --> 38:04.670
After merging, you'll be one big family.

38:05.410 --> 38:07.410
I've already talked to Mr. Sun.

38:07.590 --> 38:09.250
You should all follow his lead from now on.

38:11.150 --> 38:12.110
What does that mean?

38:12.110 --> 38:13.110
After the merger, you...

38:13.140 --> 38:14.690
You won't be in charge anymore?

38:16.050 --> 38:17.100
I should step down.

38:18.770 --> 38:21.460
Mr. Sun will be in charge from now on.

38:22.980 --> 38:24.670
Then we're done for...

38:25.360 --> 38:27.480
We are going to suffer!

38:30.650 --> 38:32.020
Don't worry, everyone.

38:32.990 --> 38:36.030
I've negotiated all the terms before the merger.

38:36.270 --> 38:38.500
I've secured all your benefits

38:38.520 --> 38:39.600
and needs,

38:41.220 --> 38:42.780
like social insurance, housing fund,

38:42.930 --> 38:44.370
paid annual leave,

38:44.710 --> 38:47.270
and also year-end performance evaluations and awards.

38:47.750 --> 38:49.590
As long as you work diligently,

38:49.610 --> 38:51.860
your benefits won't be any less than those of big companies.

39:00.070 --> 39:02.630
It's okay if you don't wanna stay.

39:03.140 --> 39:05.340
I still have some connections with HQ.

39:05.810 --> 39:07.050
if you need,

39:07.070 --> 39:08.530
I can help you negotiate it

39:08.630 --> 39:10.380
and get you into a nearby parcel delivery station.

39:11.290 --> 39:12.850
I still say the same thing.

39:13.720 --> 39:15.130
Take your time to make money.

39:16.120 --> 39:18.910
I hope you all take care of yourselves.

39:19.790 --> 39:20.980
Please, please,

39:21.240 --> 39:22.310
be careful and stay safe.

39:23.540 --> 39:25.220
I wish each and every one of you

39:25.730 --> 39:28.220
a bright and wonderful future.

39:47.710 --> 39:48.460
Wanghe?

39:48.490 --> 39:49.410
Wanghe!

39:49.430 --> 39:50.550
Wanghe.

39:50.550 --> 39:51.150
Wake up, wake up.

39:51.150 --> 39:52.320
Come on, Wanghe.

39:53.030 --> 39:55.080
Get up! Fenghua has left!

39:55.320 --> 39:56.230
Where did she go?

39:56.230 --> 39:56.880
Home.

39:56.880 --> 39:58.550
She's not coming back to Beijing after leaving.

39:58.680 --> 39:59.340
What?

39:59.480 --> 40:01.000
I wrote a time management software for her

40:01.000 --> 40:01.880
and asked her to find someone to test it.

40:01.920 --> 40:03.370
She told me to send it to Mr. Sun as she had quit

40:03.400 --> 40:05.230
and wouldn't be managing that business anymore.

40:06.670 --> 40:08.010
Hey, wait for me.

40:15.360 --> 40:18.190
♫Recalling the good old days♫

40:18.820 --> 40:22.420
♫The wind blows gently♫

40:23.300 --> 40:27.090
♫Blowing through the forest and the city♫

40:28.620 --> 40:31.400
♫Blowing through your face♫

40:32.900 --> 40:35.930
♫And my heart♫

40:35.360 --> 40:36.200
Did you get through to her?

40:36.900 --> 40:39.560
♫The wind blows gently♫

40:37.110 --> 40:38.730
She's not answering.

40:40.160 --> 40:43.170
♫Blowing through summer♫

40:43.870 --> 40:46.480
♫Blowing through the eaves♫

40:45.880 --> 40:47.780
Fenghua, Fenghua, answer my call.

40:47.110 --> 40:49.560
♫It blows past me♫

40:50.630 --> 40:54.210
♫Warm love♫

40:54.940 --> 40:56.470
♫How many years♫

40:57.190 --> 41:00.600
♫Have you changed?♫

41:01.520 --> 41:02.530
Slow down.

41:01.680 --> 41:03.330
♫I love you♫

41:03.770 --> 41:07.750
♫In dreams or in the south♫

41:05.610 --> 41:06.810
Take care, Fenghua.

41:07.150 --> 41:08.800
Take care, Fenghua!

41:08.870 --> 41:11.540
♫The wind blows gently♫

41:12.370 --> 41:15.530
♫On you♫

41:16.340 --> 41:17.840
♫That's me♫

41:18.570 --> 41:22.330
♫Missing you deeply again♫

41:48.270 --> 41:54.470
[Fenghua Express]

41:52.000 --> 41:53.960
♫That's me♫

41:54.600 --> 41:55.540
Put them down!

41:54.740 --> 42:00.050
♫Missing you deeply again♫

41:56.070 --> 41:57.130
Who let you move them?

41:57.190 --> 41:58.380
Put the things down!

42:05.360 --> 42:06.580
Oh, Mr. Xie!

42:07.010 --> 42:08.430
We've met before.

42:08.510 --> 42:09.760
Mr. Sun.

42:10.230 --> 42:11.440
Who let you move these?

42:12.030 --> 42:13.310
You don't know that yet?

42:14.640 --> 42:16.100
Ms. Xia has quit!

42:16.120 --> 42:17.780
We used to work for the same company.

42:17.800 --> 42:19.950
I've taken over this station.

42:20.960 --> 42:21.960
No way!

42:22.030 --> 42:23.240
Calm down, please.

42:23.550 --> 42:25.800
Ms. Xia and I made this decision together.

42:25.930 --> 42:26.930
Just a few days ago,

42:26.960 --> 42:29.540
we went to inspect a factory.

42:29.940 --> 42:31.500
I'm quite touched by this.

42:31.710 --> 42:33.550
If she had stayed

42:33.570 --> 42:35.900
to work here, things would have turned out even better!

43:02.550 --> 43:03.700
So she really left, huh?
